fof_version: '0.1'
type: enemy
id: chalk_lead
name: The Lead
ruleset:
  modules:
  - id: base
    version: 0.1.0
enemy:
  tier: named
  attack_modifier: 2
  defense_modifier: 1
  armor: none
  techniques:
  - unmaking_run
  special: UNMAKING RUN — once per scene, the Lead runs the full length of the road
    the pack claims. Every chalk hound that has come apart this scene reassembles
    behind it.
  description: The oldest dust on the road, and the only one of the pack with a
    colour to it — a rust-brown seam through the chalk where something bled here
    a long time ago. It is a head taller than the others and it never runs first.
  disposition: Patient in a way none of its pack is. It watches one full pass before
    it commits.
  first_target: Whoever the pack has already failed to catch.
  triggers:
  - Holds back through the first exchange, then joins on the second.
  - Spends its Unmaking Run the moment three or more hounds are down.
  morale: Withdraws down its own road at Resolve 1, and takes what is left of the
    pack with it. It does not follow anyone off the road; it has never been off
    the road.
  organization: One per pack, and a pack per road.
  notes: 'TR breakdown: offense(+2 → 4) + durability(Resolve 3) + armor(none → 0)
    + techniques(1) = 8. Meets the Named minimum exactly.'
  resolve: 3
created_at: '2026-08-02T00:00:00+00:00'
last_modified: '2026-08-02T00:00:00+00:00'
